      "type": "prose",
      "heading": "Raffle prize donors",
      "html": "<p>We’re also grateful to the businesses and organizations who generously donated raffle prizes. Every gift, large or small, helped make the event more special while supporting our programs for children and families.</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://abarrelomonkeys.com/\">A Barrel O’ Monkeys</a></li><li><a href=\"https://alanarosephotography.com/\">Alana Rose Photography</a></li><li><a href=\"http://www.Burtonsgrill.com/locations/fl/boca-raton/\">Burton’s Grill &amp; Bar</a></li><li><a href=\"https://fitfoodexpress.com/\">Fit Food Express</a></li><li><a href=\"https://tammyfender.com/pages/delray-beach-spa\">Paula Vaught at the Tammy Fender Holistic Spa</a></li><li><a href=\"https://themodernrose.com/\">The Modern Rose</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.sicilianoven.com/locations/west-delray\">The Sicilian Oven</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.sandpiperallinclusive.com/resort-pass.htm\">Voco Sandpiper All-inclusive Resort</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.totalwine.com/store-info/florida-delray-beach/942?cid=referral:website_link::momentfeed:942_delray_beach_store_details_page:\">Total Wine &amp; More</a></li><li><a href=\"https://zenpalz.com/\">Zen Palz</a></li></ul><p>Questions about the event? Contact Rivka Seeman, <a href=\"mailto:Rivka@sunflowercreativearts.org\">Rivka@SunflowerCreativeArts.org</a>.</p>"
